field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698255} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e3298b7f-af75-5403-b3a3-41d0c01ec847" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698262}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698262} :answer-field/id #uuid "da74d408-002e-57c8-865d-5b713ad7b684" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698260}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "5935a7ef-e601-5c95-9723-497e03564394" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=4\\cos\\theta+3,\\qquad y=-2\\sin\\theta-3,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $3$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-1 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta+3\\le 7 \\\\\n-1 &\\le x\\le 7.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le x\\le 7$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-2$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n2 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta\\ge-2 \\\\\n-1 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta-3\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le y\\le -1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le y\\le -1$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698230 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16b9dc48-eebf-502c-977c-badd808c44f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698210}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698210} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b230695-0a73-53a6-95f6-b98f092aaa15" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698213} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0caf2744-972b-57cf-8003-a6ff2ac71d4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698206}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698206} :answer-field/id #uuid "57aa2e32-602a-57fb-8d4e-6793ab748525" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698225} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "109fcc2b-4825-53b6-b38f-b887208533d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698208}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698208} :answer-field/id #uuid "593419f3-6d69-5015-8fe8-5b90819b4334" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698227} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fa51226f-982c-5456-ac90-799131a16ac7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698267}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698267} :answer-field/id #uuid "66cd731d-fe4a-5ef0-879c-993235a8e3b8" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698232} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7ea6ee95-4f99-5bb2-93c0-ceeaa79edaa9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698238}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698238} :answer-field/id #uuid "8faf3899-a153-51e8-aa8d-cd8d18140cc0" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698241} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b62b357a-e908-5f2f-a0a1-df8aa1402fad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698250}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698250} :answer-field/id #uuid "a30c7c88-31f6-5b34-b495-2bcef07ba6c6" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698245}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "60fa7064-5626-5afa-a435-48058884a534" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=4\\cos\\theta+1,\\qquad y=4\\sin\\theta-3,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $1$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-3 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta+1\\le 5 \\\\\n-3 &\\le x\\le 5.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-3\\le x\\le 5$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $-3$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\sin\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-7 &\\le 4\\sin\\theta-3\\le 1 \\\\\n-7 &\\le y\\le 1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-7\\le y\\le 1$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698242 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e76904c-2bb7-59d7-b51f-dd205700019b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698207}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698207} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a8cc703-afcb-5fa7-9b7d-73fcc243847f" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698212} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "72d0a2e9-8273-5b88-8c3a-086228c83efb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698235}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698235} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e522f08-228d-50a3-8fac-f53f40d4abc9" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698214} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "864cf370-886c-56bc-8332-0445cc9b8b0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698239}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698239} :answer-field/id #uuid "2201979d-0882-5bf2-8017-04103b032fe7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698217} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d29086a8-3b08-5360-ae95-de1febb2be15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698259}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698259} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f3b2e8a-8a9f-5538-8eac-11c21d9c4786" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698221} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f23cf1a-2c9c-58f9-8801-ce886e21e117" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698215}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698215} :answer-field/id #uuid "3764fa1f-077a-5a84-95d8-ed1c63fc99bf" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698223} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b9205058-f79a-5c3b-bcc0-f5ebbe24b9c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698251}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698251} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc140de5-b89c-54e8-8465-46ec75f95609" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698257}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "9513ea0a-76de-5195-8497-7480a298b184" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=-2\\sin\\theta-3,\\qquad y=2\\cos\\theta-2,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-2$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n2 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta\\ge-2 \\\\\n-1 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta-3\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le x\\le -1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le x\\le -1$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $2$ and translate by $-2$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-2 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta\\le 2 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta-2\\le 0 \\\\\n-4 &\\le y\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-4\\le y\\le 0$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698254 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "af841084-5621-5238-a454-3fef18387f50" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698249}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698249} :answer-field/id #uuid "7c2edacd-c089-55d4-9e48-9f9dfee4b315" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698237} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0770a829-e010-537f-8953-9fb78e1e494d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698205}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698205} :answer-field/id #uuid "8d68fc28-68db-5396-9456-d8e000b6c843" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698240} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e6aecf1a-7e10-5db9-a27e-bc34b60c93b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698265}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698265} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f461a8e-02c4-5bb6-b538-68185e3a76bc" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698244} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b1945b4-bc2c-5bff-9cb9-cbff1186e099" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698219}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698219} :answer-field/id #uuid "aafa2734-8d30-54e7-b981-25d240e3f051" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698248} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "610e664a-a448-5403-b8e4-1f99c1749355" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698231}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698231} :answer-field/id #uuid "c8a361ee-53e6-52e0-b4ef-a81d8e9d37db" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698256} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "045072b6-3a9d-58be-a1d1-7572d47f563c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698204}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698204} :answer-field/id #uuid "e4c1fd21-60c4-5c4c-afeb-a7bd4a15810d" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698263}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "be01a2ea-10e1-5016-b260-166998db09c2" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\nx=-3\\sin\\theta-3,\\qquad y=-4\\cos\\theta+3,\\\\\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi,\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is {{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is {{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-3$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n3 &\\ge-3\\sin\\theta\\ge-3 \\\\\n0 &\\ge-3\\sin\\theta-3\\ge-6 \\\\\n-6 &\\le x\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-6\\le x\\le 0$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-4$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $3$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n4 &\\ge-4\\cos\\theta\\ge-4 \\\\\n7 &\\ge-4\\cos\\theta+3\\ge-1 \\\\\n-1 &\\le y\\le 7.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le y\\le 7$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698403 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36dee86e-333e-5f7b-86b5-ba324a4ad24e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/b9/b9224c557b69de03ea28941e4bfae9f75441a2cd34fa35376293c9bb90f30a11.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698411} {:answer/id #uuid "62b69988-b261-52dd-845b-9c30c221fe0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/b5/b5155b2b7b7222fe2e819bd4629209de4afc99a08eb0157f1cd46bcd9667e7a0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698415} {:answer/id #uuid "793025dd-0c4c-55b6-805b-e66719d3ffa4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/24/248c6c0b1b98280cdfb1a9dae706a5c6d2b90ecc5dfe51c88874608c3e65a4d1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698420} {:answer/id #uuid "7deb2763-ec55-550a-8ad6-6cfa0ea792b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/f8/f836a60a37bfa0bcb5a3f951257513453f783d35dd0e0aa4b30b66bc614dc50a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698423} {:answer/id #uuid "a2ddf828-abda-5606-82c0-141e05fa3387" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/28/283396a457998690f493989fc872176a301322c7265eebd063c454d0c6ece465.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698427}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698415} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa0c5a85-778d-5c7b-9cbb-bec073c2cebf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698437}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "00a0ab7a-aa47-5ff6-b5b5-cd1e4da4a88e" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=3 - 4 t\\\\ y&=t - 1\\\\ &-3\\le t\\le 3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=3 - 4 t$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -3 & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ \\hline x & 15 & 11 & 7 & 3 & -1 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline x & -5 & -9 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t - 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -3 & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ \\hline x & 15 & 11 & 7 & 3 & -1 \\\\ \\hline y & -4 & -3 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline x & -5 & -9 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/f8/f87af4c6b109422b771adb8747bd3e9eedb2c36bf77604ecd6b73c3fc50a8a1c.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698404 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7cd7a60b-5de7-5d32-8895-26ade289098d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/97/97abb6b632e75fcc604b943a3e01bd78079f7a4140f53949bda39956ae0bfbef.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698421} {:answer/id #uuid "7dd1d1d3-6c68-56bb-b91c-409a69398986" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/e8/e8154b1159f05853d34af2ce3a2fd299ab5e405f54ec05a995eef2f48d22833e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698422} {:answer/id #uuid "8a74a994-f868-5d1b-b709-9d554086c3d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/55/5531e335d6b7efb0776f15f46b1341e6eca7e3a4b9117984c692b2b602ab85ef.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698425} {:answer/id #uuid "cded85d7-6dab-5342-9d1e-6cb8ab69fff6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/3e/3ef7596920fdc5e771e9fc0728885a560e80b878742f819149bedf479d0ccb90.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698432} {:answer/id #uuid "f27ea410-7245-591c-83c3-c7cce37dea5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/5d/5da01999804babd3c65342b609177c30509eaf061a332277c59e80ad2f433ff2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698435}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698425} :answer-field/id #uuid "18381a42-2526-5300-a5c5-d732c846c90c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698409}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "00b8f5db-2235-5430-9df1-2c1714ceb1c9" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=2 \\sqrt{t} - 1\\\\ y&=t + 1\\\\ &0\\le t\\le 4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=2 \\sqrt{t} - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 & 1 & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 3 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t + 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 & 1 & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\hline y & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 3 \\\\ \\hline y & 4 & 5 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/11/110abee7113f372d21760b21b3d5bb937ac30d16cba61b8a143b4a00136d1ed7.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698408 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b1db5b1-daab-58da-b1a8-4fdbd37f1cc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/89/895bf6c6adaae07f4c4cfb6436ff1216b9893cf25200b59106cf668a79ed71aa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698416} {:answer/id #uuid "6df2db16-8ef4-5189-89fe-8017c9024827" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/5d/5d3f6794f841c796739b344f94622a7be2738b885f880e113ff8e902d24c42eb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698418} {:answer/id #uuid "744e910b-fead-584b-a161-471a8875b411" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/bb/bb77b9631eddf462bd42fff76d0f00402fdec1032b24514116e9dbbd93d267f1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698419} {:answer/id #uuid "9725f2a5-cd28-5edd-9965-6d1006713660" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/6d/6d7bc901b3a0a9504f68660803823667bcb9804929b965f7c70ec8d83c4cab64.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698426} {:answer/id #uuid "ed717a29-abf7-5807-9a72-99725b979e13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/29/29f79bb276405945c9d789f5eafacd18995bb8c0b97631dfd725cbbb3df21ebc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698434}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698416} :answer-field/id #uuid "88813cf1-3cef-5b6b-a051-da9bd8cf20f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698424}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "14c25f09-be41-5b2d-922b-2a999a333136" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=2 \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 1\\\\ y&=4 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 1\\\\ &0\\le \\theta \\le 2\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=2 \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & 0 & \\frac{\\pi}{6} & \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 3 & 1 + \\sqrt{3} & 2 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & \\frac{2 \\pi}{3} & \\pi & \\frac{4 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & \\frac{5 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 2 \\\\ \\hline y &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=4 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & 0 & \\frac{\\pi}{6} & \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 3 & 1 + \\sqrt{3} & 2 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 & 3 & 1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & \\frac{2 \\pi}{3} & \\pi & \\frac{4 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 1 & 1 - 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{\\theta} & \\frac{5 \\pi}{3} \\\\ \\hline x & 2 \\\\ \\hline y & 1 - 2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/42/4257b66e25b49edbc656a9f008b54eb60c3dd811bf666307cf3b7bf20c74d04e.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698430 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08cbc62b-9bae-5046-91df-3c7ad176ba5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/c4/c41b8448501bcc7b43742d036593cbbf87568992697b78d3182f8da62ef11859.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698407} {:answer/id #uuid "5313a928-a6f2-58af-926b-60b41beed1ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/cc/cc8276787322388623463fd2c3e3d6120a34fbbf22ab5b46a31ea4eb939a4c6c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698414} {:answer/id #uuid "6dd0f39f-45d2-5d93-afdf-252be8cdaf2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/ea/eabfc4c405a02f2b554facd96d78e4cb05ce091ca3b8756abe504fd67d2950eb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698417} {:answer/id #uuid "b1ac6765-d618-50e9-b840-73b57655cc74" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/33/333900a786b4d62c04cbb270a0fd0b91e1dc64b2349806024a77c2859443161e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698428} {:answer/id #uuid "ed0f79e9-d922-5a38-94df-f9a20d8770aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/a7/a74b163fdaa43a243298cfc1d6980098e0cc8db96bd0cfceb28484133c9debf9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698433}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698433} :answer-field/id #uuid "068eeff9-ad6e-5e95-aabd-7dcbb09fe37a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698406}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "b9332517-42a9-5823-9757-c83156b88835" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=2 t - 1\\\\ y&=-1 + \\frac{5}{t}\\\\ &t>0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=2 t - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & \\frac{1}{2} & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & 0 & 1 & 3 & 5 & 7 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 5 \\\\ \\hline x & 9 \\\\ \\hline y &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=-1 + \\frac{5}{t}$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & \\frac{1}{2} & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & 0 & 1 & 3 & 5 & 7 \\\\ \\hline y & 9 & 4 & \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 5 \\\\ \\hline x & 9 \\\\ \\hline y & 0 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/f8/f8c89c1d92cd8256446fdf43bce595b02637ba2ed74cebffea6044f8f394c61b.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698431 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "053a508d-ff09-5f51-a30f-ceb3c75605c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/b6/b69aeac1f4f2d78df4253d94bff0a830414b62926c0d5177e82d18a182c5439c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698405} {:answer/id #uuid "2cb5ac91-7165-5365-ade9-a15d440a2cb8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/2b/2b65d5d239952e2c3ba9c1e89e6f0c772790d029e14a02838d5135c7d484885b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698410} {:answer/id #uuid "3f90783f-2b17-5d76-bb84-69b7e3f07c1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/bf/bf33cbe898c8180ea3a9df3d414d75c6832e01c2eac8db0297f32a97edcef8f2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698412} {:answer/id #uuid "4abba4c5-3c24-59c3-a13e-c4bb633bfd21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/86/86dd000dfd80e5dd212aa540949c75f46f1d32951abbec8daa708aeb8e784725.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698413} {:answer/id #uuid "f814f1a4-6c01-52fb-a5cd-c5934ef9db8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/70/7012f34740c3766043db40b5bb3caaed96c9998c6ced1a35205d000aa8ddc8c9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698436}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698436} :answer-field/id #uuid "b4ce42cc-af65-566a-9fdc-a5fbcc8db4c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186698429}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "bc2fb875-1e69-5e14-8cf9-ca119d224218" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=5 - 2 t^{2}\\\\ y&=2 t + 2\\\\ &-1\\le t\\le 3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=5 - 2 t^{2}$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline x & 3 & 5 & 3 & -3 & -13 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=2 t + 2$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\hline x & 3 & 5 & 3 & -3 & -13 \\\\ \\hline y & 0 & 2 & 4 & 6 & 8 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/e0/e06b71f5c9e0f3076a8dcd534fa24ce5b319a7568e70b63f857e6150537e4ec7.png)"}]}
